      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Richmond%2C_Maine",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Swan Island, part of Richmond, hosts a 2,019‑acre Steve Powell Wildlife Management Area, a National Register‑listed sanctuary.",
